Placeholder so `tauri.conf.json`'s `bundle.resources` path exists at build time.
The real contents — the PyInstaller onedir build of the backend — are staged
here by `packaging/build_backend.ps1` before `tauri build` and are gitignored.
An empty desktop shell build (dev / `cargo build`) ships only this file, and
`backend.rs` finds no `workbench-server.exe`, so it falls back to `uv run`.
